s_order":null,"call_locator":"66e0a86d61dcfda9304b9d87aad007606e0947ddcb7f7ecc148bab097e07dd50","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"699def4ac6eeddd733d6eac592c5f62f41f79e285e7463e9d9c450a9ea80adf1","logical_entry_identity":"03b3a8f50795ec77925d29d869a2c0af660bd6c49456b895e131f89ddfdaa1dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lord of Skulls","source_tag":"talent name","target":"骷髅王"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6b1d9416f4cfd93efe3673b53a0d8eff6f52e8e8a710bde6e2b041add63fe98","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69a619ad3d2d9c8f8ca3d4eb72727f2bcbf88c4a084b364a857173ffeb37a290","logical_entry_identity":"63967e5117b969eb6aa2cb3b2523c4c351698badd2a281aa0f52e79a35e4b608","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Maximum souls: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"灵魂上限："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a31442385a629162c129091bd0898ab2da34a02a249a2db5511348412fd71808","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69ad21f36fbd47db893d78eb339fc60b88ef15bce47a547ee5cfdcf6015380f1","logical_entry_identity":"327fb13daa47c1f098ee1d302bbbd3d24379bcee97ab90f8ca984329afb3c73a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source# aims %s %s at #target#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#用%s%s瞄准了#target#！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a23a7daf5ccfb341979894144822af55b839635a1f6e028d7f806cca0893452","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69b104795d57d4321e9d242f84e98c4b514633207ce4166f28f6c5ab449ead5d","logical_entry_identity":"7a9d26aef3eca00f704fdb9ab4ced3e926e21c4b74bb91fdaf5ce462083a8444","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"heal %d; cd %d","source_tag":"tformat","target":"治疗 %d; 冷却 %d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6372aa4432b6748ffcf7056b8ea4e21f66090df5829e0d57053555de2209c178","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69b1ce8a2bf73191353641890bbc6a260e0c81296a2a8a5839d3bad104502205","logical_entry_identity":"68da8317a6bf66a3abf2d9c9d361fba29a933b866e4f556a1a855e4f7405c360","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Naloren (or Nalore - lit \"siblings of spirit\") are now an extinct race, as their homeland was swept into the sea by the Cataclysm. However as a separate elf race they are worth studying, scant though the records be. Much of what is now said about the Naloren is traced with myth, but one can deduce certain facts.\n\nNaloren elves were around 5'10\", with blonde hair and green eyes. They were incredibly thin, but known for their swift and dextrous capabilities. Their kingdom was located on the eastern side of Maj'Eyal, and all of their towns were on the sea or straddling major rivers. They employed themselves as fishermen, sponge-divers, sailors and musicians. They were renowned for being able to stay underwater for hours at a time, and those with arcane abilities were said to be able to stay submerged indefinitely.\n\nThey traded little with the other races, and were very protective of their coastal lands. They most especially guarded jealously an ancient Sher'Tul ruin that lay in the centre of their territories. The Shaloren were in particular keen to study this relic, but the Naloren always refused them access, though they were too afraid to touch it themselves. The orcs were said to encroach on their lands often, but were always fought back by their mail-clad warriors wielding vicious tridents.\n\nAlas their love of the sea was to be their undoing. When the Cataclysm came the whole of the coastal kingdom was shorn away and fell into the sea, annihilating almost the entire race. What small numbers survived committed suicide soon after by leaping from the eastern cliffs into the ocean, following their fallen brothers and sisters. Almost no evidence of their civilisation remains.","source_tag":"_t","target":"纳鲁精灵（或纳精灵——“精神之源”）是一支绝迹的种族，他们的大陆因大灾变的影响而沉入大海。不过，作为精灵族的分支种族，他们还是很多值得研究的地方，虽然历史记载很少。许多人说纳鲁精灵是虚构出来的，但是有人可以推测出某些史实。\n\n纳鲁精灵大约在5英尺10英寸左右，有着亚麻色的长发和绿色的眼睛。他们非常瘦弱，但却以敏捷的身手和灵巧的行动而闻名。他们的王国座落在马基·埃亚尔的东部地区，并且他们所有的城镇都建在海边或者河边。他们擅长捕鱼、采集海绵、航海和音乐。他们同样以超长的水下屏息能力而闻名，并且那些掌握了魔法的人甚至可以做到水下呼吸。\n\n他们很少与外界交易，并且很重视他们的土地。他们尤其小心守护的是他们领土中心一个古老的夏·图尔遗迹。永恒精灵们非常渴望研究它们，虽然纳鲁们自己很害怕接触它，但是却始终拒绝永恒精灵们进入。据说兽人们经常侵略他们的边境，但是总能被他们武装整齐、手持三叉戟的精锐战士击退。\n\n可悲的是他们对大海的爱已成往事。当大灾变来临之时，整个半岛王国四分五裂、沉入大海，整个种族几乎毁灭。所剩无几的幸存者决定从东边悬崖跳海自杀，追随他们已逝的兄弟姐妹。整个文明都基本消弭了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"17fe6800dd03c0df2bf0f1ce4d6e1421ad06971fd1c40563e7416157c274419b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69b54b4c96f0ebcb4d3d1503e1f196a5567c247e43b2fb836353fc3f4b75e5df","logical_entry_identity":"1d4d70aa63ae73e12cba0cb09627f43e6f7f61aface62e05f2df4795716b2edd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This is great news! I will tell her at once.","source_tag":"_t","target":"太好了！我马上告诉她。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9a7367b54b1b8c3631e7f5eb02678258909ca3ca8eca0b15ccde4bae5030f89a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69b94799c66bc4ce446de4c7084b15dce92d3aa3ba1e54fb21d1350b89c272cc","logical_entry_identity":"569f991e793f8b7639343ac62fc4ed8be20109ab95bd2959a7dda42bb454173e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Righteous Strength","source_tag":"_t","target":"-光明之力"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b6f0b0be283b9cccf1c6c63c404ecffc17d625ecc5fe82255541945ec8458e89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69bba0d7c2fdc4a0bf2be8131b1327ecf67e0ac77031a14df02d313111ba1b55","logical_entry_identity":"2f6ba430448e0f2c45e4caae7ec8bda913533849e1dc9b83fddf5eed18c706c3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Quest #LIGHT_GREEN#Done!","source_tag":"_t","target":"任务 #LIGHT_GREEN#完成！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"319ec984058800b849012676fe9dbe549a696227e29d423ea215a9d2481ebe48","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69bbe9389086921ddc367814af5de9e64d62f6fd8a4d68c7b1747036a94aa914","logical_entry_identity":"3064959ea07ebaba92354d0654fac97b19758e778c79badd2f7e8377a624aa24","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This rift in time has been created by the paradox. You dare not enter it; it could make things worse. Another Warden will have to f